<title>INDIA: India produced 45,390 tonnes aluminium in November.</title>
<headline>India produced 45,390 tonnes aluminium in November.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 45,390 tonnes of aluminium in November against a target of 46,024 tonnes, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The country produced 341,404 tonnes of aluminium during April-November compared with 340,480 tonnes in the same period last year, the statement said.</p>
<p>It said the state-run National Aluminium Company Ltd exported 58,315 tonnes of alumina and 3,663 tonnes of aluminium in November.</p>
